"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":1906823755,"text":"The pattern of flowing wind carved on the rosewood... and the strings still feel cool to the touch too. Oh, the memories...","nextNodeIds":[3790204]},{"nodeId":3790204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"Jean","textMapHash":1526802059,"text":"What do you think, Venti? Can you summon Dvalin?","nextNodeIds":[3790205]},{"nodeId":3790205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":1407121315,"text":"Although this lyre is the real thing, I doubt that it's going to work.","nextNodeIds":[3790206]},{"nodeId":3790206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":3482148347,"text":"As you can see, the lyre has been through a thousand years of history. Its Anemo power has run dry.","nextNodeIds":[3790207]},{"nodeId":3790207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":2253017291,"text":"In this condition, you couldn't play music fit for even Diluc's tavern with it...","nextNodeIds":[3790208]},{"nodeId":3790208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"Diluc","textMapHash":3746713851,"text":"Bards fight to get on the stage of my tavern. Don't make assumptions!","nextNodeIds":[3790209]},{"nodeId":3790209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":929409475,"text":"Is that really important right now, Master Diluc!?","nextNodeIds":[3790210]},{"nodeId":3790210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3481033827,"text":"And you — did you just borrow the Holy Lyre to play music for drunkards to hear?","nextNodeIds":[3790211]},{"nodeId":3790211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":690665051,"text":"Hehe.","nextNodeIds":[3790212]},{"nodeId":3790212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":169426731,"text":"What do you mean \"hehe\"!?","nextNodeIds":[3790213]},{"nodeId":3790213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":2341363347,"text":"Anyway, we won't be able to call Dvalin with it.","nextNodeIds":[3790214]},{"nodeId":3790214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":841775947,"text":"The lyre itself is fine, but the strings...","nextNodeIds":[3790215]},{"nodeId":3790215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":1402754419,"text":"You're up, outlander!","nextNodeIds":[3790216,3790217]},{"nodeId":3790216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1799234091,"text":"Are you talking about me?","nextNodeIds":[3790218]},{"nodeId":3790218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":441959027,"text":"Relax! It's not broken.","nextNodeIds":[3790219]},{"nodeId":3790219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":640952355,"text":"It's just that the intensity of its Anemo power has greatly diminished.","nextNodeIds":[3790220]},{"nodeId":3790220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"Venti","textMapHash":1684301459,"text":"#{NICKNAME}, do you still have Dvalin's Teardrop Crystal with you?","nextNodeIds":[3790221]},{"nodeId":3790221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3522073971,"text":"*nods*","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":3790217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2443911091,"text":"I don't know how to fix instruments.","nextNodeIds":[3790218]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1009,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_ENTER_ROOM","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLP